		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "6eb08c4b-0466-4357-8c92-3ddb1dd50009")
		(at 156.5 101.37 180)
		(descr "Vishay VSMB2948SL side-looking 940 nm IR emitter, 2.3x2.55x2.3 mm MiniLED side-view package (LCSC C6604342). Pads 0.9x1.2, 4.2 mm outer span (Vishay IPC-7351 pad proposal). Pad 1=K, pad 2=A. Optical axis is parallel to the PCB along -Y, i.e. the TOP edge of the footprint faces the board edge: lens tip at y=-1.37, lens base / body front face at y=-0.42, body back at y=+1.18, optical axis 1.15 mm above the PCB. Place the origin 1.37 mm inside the board edge for a flush lens.")
